sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as LazyColumn (Paging)
    participant PS as PagingSource (Room)
    participant RM as RemoteMediator
    participant Net as Feed API (cursor)
    participant Room as Room SSOT (Ch 3)

    UI->>PS: page from DB (window)
    PS-->>UI: cached items (instant, offline-capable)
    UI->>RM: scroll near edge -> load APPEND
    RM->>Net: GET feed?after=<lastCursor>
    Net-->>RM: ranked page + nextCursor (Ch 73)
    RM->>Room: insert items + remote key (dedup by id)
    Room-->>PS: new items -> PagingSource invalidates
    PS-->>UI: appended items (position preserved)
